  "slug": "quick-mushroom-ceviche",
  "name": "Quick Mushroom Ceviche",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "Mushroom ceviche can be served with crackers or chips, a quick vegan dip that is very tasty. This recipe uses canned mushrooms, so it takes very little time to prepare.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine mushrooms, onion, and cilantro in a glass bowl. Add ketchup and lime juice; mix well. Season with salt. Chill for 30 minutes. Sprinkle with chopped avocado before serving."
    }
  ],
